  unitName: Holy Eir (EU)
  unitId: 730114
  unitNumber: 7027
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. After years of war, Eir has
    saved more lives than she has brought souls to heaven. The grateful people have
    built altars in her name, and bards are singing songs in her honor. They are
    the source of her new gained power.
  summonDesc: I shall use my power to heal those who seek tranquility
  fusionDesc: Thank you! Your kindness will be repaid
  evoDesc: I'll use this power to protect more souls.
  element: 3
  rarity: 4
